---
title: Configuration Resolution - OmniSign (three-layer merge)
---
flowchart TB
  O["OperationConfig<br/>per-call overrides (CLI flags / request)<br/>HIGHEST priority"]
  P["ProfileConfig<br/>per-profile overrides (e.g. qualified-cz)"]
  G["GlobalConfig<br/>defaults: hash, encryption, signature level,<br/>timestamp server, OCSP / CRL, disabled algorithms<br/>LOWEST priority"]
  RESOLVE["ResolvedConfig.resolve()<br/>scalar fields: operation ?? profile ?? global (first non-null wins)<br/>disabled-algorithm sets: UNION of all three layers<br/>rejects a resolved algorithm that is in the disabled set"]
  R["ResolvedConfig<br/>effective signing parameters<br/>(hash, encryption, level, TSA, OCSP / CRL, trust)"]

  O --> RESOLVE
  P --> RESOLVE
  G --> RESOLVE
  RESOLVE --> R

  classDef layer fill:#1168bd,stroke:#0b4884,color:#ffffff
  classDef fn fill:#fff8c5,stroke:#9a6700,color:#24292f
  classDef result fill:#2da44e,stroke:#0d4f22,color:#ffffff
  class O,P,G layer
  class RESOLVE fn
  class R result
